==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Triton (moon)|Triton]] is the largest moon orbiting Neptune.
*The design of Triton's base is a reference to the manga ''[[wikipedia:Triton of the Sea|Triton of the Sea]]'', which features a white dolphin with the same yellow V-like symbol on its forehead.

